# Ghostex's push relay, on the share relay's name: add these two handle blocks inside the
# existing share.ghostex.dev site (server/share-relay/deploy/Caddyfile), above its reverse_proxy line.
# Caddy holds the certificate; the relay listens on loopback only. /push/ takes a larger body because a
# widget snapshot may be up to 8 KiB on its own; the relay refuses anything over its own limits.
	handle /live-activity/* {
		request_body {
			max_size 8KB
		}
		reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:58810
	}
	handle /push/* {
		request_body {
			max_size 16KB
		}
		reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:58810
	}
